OL,5,G1930 EFL Cup Live
OL,6,     FMiddlesbrough v Wrexham (Kick-off
OL,7,     F8.00pm). Mark Pougatch presents
OL,8,     Fall the action from the
OL,9,     Ffirst-round tie at Riverside
OL,10,     FStadium. Boro will be looking to
OL,11,     Favoid a repeat of this stage last
OL,12,     Fseason, when they were beaten 4-0
OL,13,     Fhere by Doncaster Rovers. Wrexham
OL,14,     Ffared better in the competition,
OL,15,     Fgoing on to reach the fourth round
OL,16,     Fbefore they were eliminated by
OL,17,     FWelsh rivals Cardiff City
OL,18,     Ffollowing a 2-1 defeat. With
OL,19,     Fanalysis from Tommy Smith and
OL,20,     FSteven Fletcher, and commentary by
OL,21,     FSeb Hutchinson and Lucy Ward
